(6482987, 963626, 117717, '<td valign="top">I once took a series of photos of my teenage niece eating a street dog, she was ready to kill me at first, but she''s a good sport &amp; let me click away... we had a lot of laughs over it- This shot brings back some fun memories! Evoking a smile is always worth an extra point in my book!</td>', 'I once took a series of photos of my teenage niece eating a street dog, she was ready to kill me at first, but she''s a good sport & let me click away... we had a lot of laughs over it- This shot brings back some fun memories! Evoking a smile is always worth an extra point in my book!', '2011-07-28 01:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6482989, 964084, 117717, '<td valign="top">The eyes are definitely the main focus here.  There seems to be a yellow cast to the image.</td>', 'The eyes are definitely the main focus here.  There seems to be a yellow cast to the image.', '2011-07-28 01:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
