(6483047, 963777, 61084, '<td valign="top">Way to much haloing around the hands takes away from the shot. Nice use of DOF though to focus the attention on the thumb and needle.</td>', 'Way to much haloing around the hands takes away from the shot. Nice use of DOF though to focus the attention on the thumb and needle.', '2011-07-28 05:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
