(6483049, 963897, 61084, '<td valign="top">Wendy? I''m beginning to think these squirrels are stuffed and you just place them where you want. LOL. If it''s not Wendy...consider it a compliment. :) 9</td>', 'Wendy? I''m beginning to think these squirrels are stuffed and you just place them where you want. LOL. If it''s not Wendy...consider it a compliment. :) 9', '2011-07-28 05:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
