(6483061, 963968, 61084, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, really nice even lighting, great clarity. I may be wrong, but I''m going to guess that this is one of Karen''s. One way or another great job! 9</td>', 'Cute idea, really nice even lighting, great clarity. I may be wrong, but I''m going to guess that this is one of Karen''s. One way or another great job! 9', '2011-07-28 05:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
