(6483150, 963320, 96751, '<td valign="top">Incredible camouflage!  But which sense is this supposed to be?</td>', 'Incredible camouflage!  But which sense is this supposed to be?', '2011-07-28 11:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483152, 963994, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blur, but too tightly cropped for me.  This should probably have been entered into the NOT sense challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful blur, but too tightly cropped for me.  This should probably have been entered into the NOT sense challenge.', '2011-07-28 11:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483153, 963836, 96751, '<td valign="top">Spectacular.  Seems awfully close...</td>', 'Spectacular.  Seems awfully close...', '2011-07-28 11:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483158, 963987, 96751, '<td valign="top">Marvelous pov.  Love the worried brows.</td>', 'Marvelous pov.  Love the worried brows.', '2011-07-28 11:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483160, 964062, 96751, '<td valign="top">Miss the Met.  Great street shot.</td>', 'Miss the Met.  Great street shot.', '2011-07-28 11:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483161, 964017, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice!!</td>', 'Nice!!', '2011-07-28 11:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483162, 963564, 96751, '<td valign="top">Oh wow.  Haven''t seen one of these in a while.  Great artifact.  Might have been even better in b/w.</td>', 'Oh wow.  Haven''t seen one of these in a while.  Great artifact.  Might have been even better in b/w.', '2011-07-28 11:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483163, 963897, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wendy, you REALLY have a way with squirrels.</td>', 'Wendy, you REALLY have a way with squirrels.', '2011-07-28 12:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483164, 964059, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Perhaps a bit oversaturated, but nice dof.</td>', 'Awesome.  Perhaps a bit oversaturated, but nice dof.', '2011-07-28 12:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483165, 963970, 96751, '<td valign="top">Terrifying and fascinating.  Brilliant pp''ing.  Straight to faves.</td>', 'Terrifying and fascinating.  Brilliant pp''ing.  Straight to faves.', '2011-07-28 12:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483167, 963902, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ha!  I love how the toes are straight but the image is tilted.  Nice.</td>', 'Ha!  I love how the toes are straight but the image is tilted.  Nice.', '2011-07-28 12:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483168, 963988, 96751, '<td valign="top">Is this a partner image to the hands with Seranwrap?  ''m intrigued by all the odd containers in the back.</td>', 'Is this a partner image to the hands with Seranwrap?  ''m intrigued by all the odd containers in the back.', '2011-07-28 12:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483170, 963723, 96751, '<td valign="top">That''s one heck of a bug!!!  And macro!!</td>', 'That''s one heck of a bug!!!  And macro!!', '2011-07-28 12:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483172, 964061, 96751, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I only saw the bottom part of the pink things, and I thought it was a tiny little tongue sticking out!!!  Incredible macro.  Top 10 for me.</td>', 'At first glance, I only saw the bottom part of the pink things, and I thought it was a tiny little tongue sticking out!!!  Incredible macro.  Top 10 for me.', '2011-07-28 12:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483173, 963791, 96751, '<td valign="top">I LOVE how the particles create an alternate universe of lighting.</td>', 'I LOVE how the particles create an alternate universe of lighting.', '2011-07-28 12:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483174, 963924, 96751, '<td valign="top">Magnificent vista.   Looks like PCH.</td>', 'Magnificent vista.   Looks like PCH.', '2011-07-28 12:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483175, 964011, 96751, '<td valign="top">Terrific portrait.  Love the expression.</td>', 'Terrific portrait.  Love the expression.', '2011-07-28 12:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483176, 963990, 96751, '<td valign="top">Water ballet?  Synchronized swimming?  I love flamingos.</td>', 'Water ballet?  Synchronized swimming?  I love flamingos.', '2011-07-28 12:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483177, 963981, 96751, '<td valign="top">Except for the tilt, this is a lovely image.  Great lighting.</td>', 'Except for the tilt, this is a lovely image.  Great lighting.', '2011-07-28 12:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483178, 964043, 96751, '<td valign="top">Awww.  This is an example of an image that might have worked better in color!</td>', 'Awww.  This is an example of an image that might have worked better in color!', '2011-07-28 12:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483179, 963653, 96751, '<td valign="top">Cats have the BEST profiles.</td>', 'Cats have the BEST profiles.', '2011-07-28 12:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483180, 963980, 96751, '<td valign="top">While I love the lighting and low key, the pose is too forced for me.</td>', 'While I love the lighting and low key, the pose is too forced for me.', '2011-07-28 12:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483181, 963934, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Marvelous birds.</td>', 'Wow.  Marvelous birds.', '2011-07-28 12:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483183, 964094, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love the symmetry of this, but feel like a MUCH closer crop (with her almost centered) would have more visual punch.</td>', 'I love the symmetry of this, but feel like a MUCH closer crop (with her almost centered) would have more visual punch.', '2011-07-28 12:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483184, 964084, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes!!!</td>', 'Beautiful eyes!!!', '2011-07-28 12:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483185, 963968, 96751, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!!!  And yummy.  Haven''t seen those fruit slices in forever.    Great idea and nice set-up.  Just needs a little more contrast for my tastes.</td>', 'Hilarious!!!  And yummy.  Haven''t seen those fruit slices in forever.    Great idea and nice set-up.  Just needs a little more contrast for my tastes.', '2011-07-28 12:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483186, 963742, 96751, '<td valign="top">Somehow, it does feel that way</td>', 'Somehow, it does feel that way', '2011-07-28 12:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483187, 964089, 96751, '<td valign="top">You are SO in trouble...</td>', 'You are SO in trouble...', '2011-07-28 12:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483188, 964088, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous, inventive, fun interpretation.</td>', 'Fabulous, inventive, fun interpretation.', '2011-07-28 12:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483189, 963561, 96751, '<td valign="top">The slight tilt is the only issue I have with this wonderful image.</td>', 'The slight tilt is the only issue I have with this wonderful image.', '2011-07-28 12:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483208, 964059, 16046, '<td valign="top">10 super</td>', '10 super', '2011-07-28 12:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483210, 964061, 16046, '<td valign="top">Awesome</td>', 'Awesome', '2011-07-28 12:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483232, 963868, 69034, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Great shot, editing, and the subject matter is fun as well.</td>', 'Awesome.  Great shot, editing, and the subject matter is fun as well.', '2011-07-28 13:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483235, 963897, 69034, '<td valign="top">What is it with Squirrels. . .am I missing something. Well done shot, appreciate the subject matter relating to the challenge. . .which seems to not be happening much on this one.</td>', 'What is it with Squirrels. . .am I missing something. Well done shot, appreciate the subject matter relating to the challenge. . .which seems to not be happening much on this one.', '2011-07-28 13:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483353, 963957, 135301, '<td valign="top">gewoon perfect hahahah xD</td>', 'gewoon perfect hahahah xD', '2011-07-28 17:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483379, 963990, 103048, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! I''d give it a perfect 10 had the water been slightly lighter, so the colours on its wings would stand out more. That said, it doesn''t take away anything from the capture.</td>', 'Beautiful shot! I''d give it a perfect 10 had the water been slightly lighter, so the colours on its wings would stand out more. That said, it doesn''t take away anything from the capture.', '2011-07-28 19:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483391, 964061, 103048, '<td valign="top">u</td>', 'u', '2011-07-28 19:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483498, 963897, 117717, '<td valign="top">This is just so sweet!  Great detail.</td>', 'This is just so sweet!  Great detail.', '2011-07-28 23:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483499, 963910, 117717, '<td valign="top">Interesting moody atmosphere.</td>', 'Interesting moody atmosphere.', '2011-07-28 23:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483507, 963270, 117717, '<td valign="top">Nice concept</td>', 'Nice concept', '2011-07-28 23:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483514, 963812, 117717, '<td valign="top">The eyes are overly processed for me but the tight crop is effective.</td>', 'The eyes are overly processed for me but the tight crop is effective.', '2011-07-29 00:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483523, 963994, 117717, '<td valign="top">Good title for this shot.  Seems that this image would be a better fit in the ''Not the Five Senses'' challenge.  <br/>Like the sense of energy.</td>', 'Good title for this shot.  Seems that this image would be a better fit in the ''Not the Five Senses'' challenge.  Like the sense of energy.', '2011-07-29 00:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483526, 964103, 117717, '<td valign="top">Like the pop of blue.</td>', 'Like the pop of blue.', '2011-07-29 00:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483531, 963981, 117717, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2011-07-29 00:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483544, 963836, 117717, '<td valign="top">Great capture!</td>', 'Great capture!', '2011-07-29 00:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483549, 963970, 117717, '<td valign="top">You have really conveyed a sense of morbidity to me.  Memorable image.</td>', 'You have really conveyed a sense of morbidity to me.  Memorable image.', '2011-07-29 00:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483550, 963902, 117717, '<td valign="top">Looks like you were having fun!</td>', 'Looks like you were having fun!', '2011-07-29 00:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483553, 964052, 117717, '<td valign="top">What an adorable expression.  Like the lighting &amp; the black &amp; white.</td>', 'What an adorable expression.  Like the lighting & the black & white.', '2011-07-29 00:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483554, 963968, 117717, '<td valign="top">Clever &amp; fun idea.  Well done.</td>', 'Clever & fun idea.  Well done.', '2011-07-29 00:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483555, 964061, 117717, '<td valign="top">Terrific focus, like the green on green on green.  What''s next on the menu?</td>', 'Terrific focus, like the green on green on green.  What''s next on the menu?', '2011-07-29 00:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483558, 964043, 117717, '<td valign="top">One day this baby will grow up &amp; ask... "Why was I in a bucket?" LOL!   So precious,  I just want to touch those toes!  You really conveyed the sense of touch with this photo.</td>', 'One day this baby will grow up & ask... "Why was I in a bucket?" LOL!   So precious,  I just want to touch those toes!  You really conveyed the sense of touch with this photo.', '2011-07-29 00:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483566, 963980, 117717, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it''s meant to be humorous but I can''t help smiling- flexing while applying deodorant!  Anyways, a great shot with gorgeous  um... lighting.</td>', 'Not sure if it''s meant to be humorous but I can''t help smiling- flexing while applying deodorant!  Anyways, a great shot with gorgeous  um... lighting.', '2011-07-29 00:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483569, 964017, 117717, '<td valign="top">Great timing.</td>', 'Great timing.', '2011-07-29 00:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483570, 964059, 117717, '<td valign="top">Great  colours &amp; dof.</td>', 'Great  colours & dof.', '2011-07-29 00:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483572, 963934, 117717, '<td valign="top">The bokeh compliments the hawk nicely.</td>', 'The bokeh compliments the hawk nicely.', '2011-07-29 00:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483574, 964107, 117717, '<td valign="top">I guess it is a matter of taste!  Love the b&amp;w.</td>', 'I guess it is a matter of taste!  Love the b&w.', '2011-07-29 00:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483583, 964011, 117717, '<td valign="top">Cute subject.  Like the tight framing.</td>', 'Cute subject.  Like the tight framing.', '2011-07-29 00:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6483889, 963777, 116631, '<td valign="top">This picture will no doubt give some people the heebie jeebies!  LOL</td>', 'This picture will no doubt give some people the heebie jeebies!  LOL', '2011-07-29 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484166, 963934, 136232, '<td valign="top">Would help bring emphasis to the theme if the eyes were more lit, or cropped to see just the head.  Beautiful shot of the hawk though.</td>', 'Would help bring emphasis to the theme if the eyes were more lit, or cropped to see just the head.  Beautiful shot of the hawk though.', '2011-07-29 14:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484168, 964061, 136232, '<td valign="top">Using a smaller aperture would help get the entire insect in focus.  I''m impressed you got this close without scaring him off!</td>', 'Using a smaller aperture would help get the entire insect in focus.  I''m impressed you got this close without scaring him off!', '2011-07-29 14:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484170, 963926, 136232, '<td valign="top">Cute, rare humming bird that is not in motion.  It would look cool if you could get this pic while the sun is rising/setting for the pinks/reds to add to the warmth.</td>', 'Cute, rare humming bird that is not in motion.  It would look cool if you could get this pic while the sun is rising/setting for the pinks/reds to add to the warmth.', '2011-07-29 14:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484172, 963742, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, I don''t exactly understand the title.</td>', 'Nice picture, I don''t exactly understand the title.', '2011-07-29 14:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484175, 963812, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice eyes.  The glowing part is a reflection of the tapedum lucidum in the back of the eye.  If you wanted the cat to look more black/reduce the greeness you can either manually have the flash come around a second before you take the photo, or use the "night" setting on your camera.  Does give interesting texture of the cat''s face though.</td>', 'Nice eyes.  The glowing part is a reflection of the tapedum lucidum in the back of the eye.  If you wanted the cat to look more black/reduce the greeness you can either manually have the flash come around a second before you take the photo, or use the "night" setting on your camera.  Does give interesting texture of the cat''s face though.', '2011-07-29 14:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484178, 963987, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice use of expression through the eyes (which is a compliment to your subject).  I like the sepia tone.</td>', 'Nice use of expression through the eyes (which is a compliment to your subject).  I like the sepia tone.', '2011-07-29 14:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484179, 963799, 136232, '<td valign="top">This might look even cooler if you did a macro shot, zooming in on the food on the grill and see it sizzle.  You don''t have to include the entire grill for the viewer, and sometimes limiting the amount of information in the pic gives it a sense of a puzzle to figure out. The bright vegetables look delicious.</td>', 'This might look even cooler if you did a macro shot, zooming in on the food on the grill and see it sizzle.  You don''t have to include the entire grill for the viewer, and sometimes limiting the amount of information in the pic gives it a sense of a puzzle to figure out. The bright vegetables look delicious.', '2011-07-29 14:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484181, 963270, 136232, '<td valign="top">This is a double-play on both sound and sight!</td>', 'This is a double-play on both sound and sight!', '2011-07-29 14:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484183, 963836, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice, lightning shots are hard to do.</td>', 'Nice, lightning shots are hard to do.', '2011-07-29 14:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484185, 963979, 136232, '<td valign="top">Cute, clear colors.  I''m imagining something fun and lighthearted being played. Clean useful face, very well focused.</td>', 'Cute, clear colors.  I''m imagining something fun and lighthearted being played. Clean useful face, very well focused.', '2011-07-29 14:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484187, 963723, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the angle you''ve achieved, as well as the iredecent reflection you caught within the eye.  The pastels on the surface makes me think the sun is about to set, yet the brighness of the insect body remains bright and textured!  Contains both sight of the model and a sight to the viewer!</td>', 'I love the angle you''ve achieved, as well as the iredecent reflection you caught within the eye.  The pastels on the surface makes me think the sun is about to set, yet the brighness of the insect body remains bright and textured!  Contains both sight of the model and a sight to the viewer!', '2011-07-29 14:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484190, 963873, 136232, '<td valign="top">Without the title, I wouldn''t know which sense you chose right away. Having someone smell the flower, or have it juxtaposed to a perfume bottle would help.  Nice overcast/rainy day pick with bright magentas though.</td>', 'Without the title, I wouldn''t know which sense you chose right away. Having someone smell the flower, or have it juxtaposed to a perfume bottle would help.  Nice overcast/rainy day pick with bright magentas though.', '2011-07-29 14:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484195, 964026, 68586, '<td valign="top">That looks kinda like Boone to me  :-)</td>', 'That looks kinda like Boone to me  :-)', '2011-07-29 14:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484196, 964024, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like how the mother is slightly more tan, and has a few freckles on her skin in contrast to the pale smoothness of the baby.  The wisps of hair framing their faces gives a nice visual texture as well. It could go even further if the mother had more texture on her dress, like the back to contrast even more with the smoothness of the baby''s clothing, juxtaposing new and polished with classic textured.</td>', 'I like how the mother is slightly more tan, and has a few freckles on her skin in contrast to the pale smoothness of the baby.  The wisps of hair framing their faces gives a nice visual texture as well. It could go even further if the mother had more texture on her dress, like the back to contrast even more with the smoothness of the baby''s clothing, juxtaposing new and polished with classic textured.', '2011-07-29 14:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484197, 963897, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice set up, and crop works well  :- )</td>', 'Nice set up, and crop works well  :- )', '2011-07-29 14:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484198, 963957, 136232, '<td valign="top">Would be neat if her hold head was in motion, s if she was head-banging to the music.</td>', 'Would be neat if her hold head was in motion, s if she was head-banging to the music.', '2011-07-29 14:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484199, 964062, 136232, '<td valign="top">A classy feel to an older generation''s music.</td>', 'A classy feel to an older generation''s music.', '2011-07-29 14:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484201, 963907, 136232, '<td valign="top">Intense eye shot.  Really brings out the texture of the iris, yet still maintains an interesting light angle and even shadow of the eyelashes against the eye.  Difficult to do within a macro shot!</td>', 'Intense eye shot.  Really brings out the texture of the iris, yet still maintains an interesting light angle and even shadow of the eyelashes against the eye.  Difficult to do within a macro shot!', '2011-07-29 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484202, 963653, 68586, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but I wonder whether by keeping the eye in focus the overall picture looks too soft ?<br/> <br/>nice concept and composition though :- )</td>', 'Nice idea but I wonder whether by keeping the eye in focus the overall picture looks too soft ? nice concept and composition though :- )', '2011-07-29 14:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484205, 963726, 136232, '<td valign="top">You could have a string comming down from one of the paperclips, so it looks like the music is literally comming from the radio.</td>', 'You could have a string comming down from one of the paperclips, so it looks like the music is literally comming from the radio.', '2011-07-29 14:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484207, 963932, 136232, '<td valign="top">Sweet.  If you play around with angles more, you an get really interesting shots with the light pastel girl and flowers framed by the darker tree background.</td>', 'Sweet.  If you play around with angles more, you an get really interesting shots with the light pastel girl and flowers framed by the darker tree background.', '2011-07-29 14:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484215, 963902, 136232, '<td valign="top">Beautiful foreshortening piece, which makes it very interesting!  I can virtually feel the gritty sand and the cool refreshing water.  Even the foot is slightly curled to give the bottom a rumply texture!</td>', 'Beautiful foreshortening piece, which makes it very interesting!  I can virtually feel the gritty sand and the cool refreshing water.  Even the foot is slightly curled to give the bottom a rumply texture!', '2011-07-29 14:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484218, 963988, 136232, '<td valign="top">The back-light from the outside looks neat, and if you played with the light on the inside it would give an interesting light/shadow effect from right to left.</td>', 'The back-light from the outside looks neat, and if you played with the light on the inside it would give an interesting light/shadow effect from right to left.', '2011-07-29 14:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484222, 963868, 136232, '<td valign="top">Literal and figurative both emphasized.   I love the texture and light reflection of the brick road and the folds within the clothes.</td>', 'Literal and figurative both emphasized.   I love the texture and light reflection of the brick road and the folds within the clothes.', '2011-07-29 14:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484225, 963910, 136232, '<td valign="top">Defocused pictures can give a warm, fuzzy feel- but it helps when you have either an easily identified subject, or an interesting use of colors to make it look purposeful.</td>', 'Defocused pictures can give a warm, fuzzy feel- but it helps when you have either an easily identified subject, or an interesting use of colors to make it look purposeful.', '2011-07-29 14:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484228, 964020, 136232, '<td valign="top">Would help with title if had a cookie on the music sheet itself, or a subtle fruit drawing between the folds of music.</td>', 'Would help with title if had a cookie on the music sheet itself, or a subtle fruit drawing between the folds of music.', '2011-07-29 14:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484231, 964084, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting, color, and texture of the face.  Handsome photo of a real person.</td>', 'I love the lighting, color, and texture of the face.  Handsome photo of a real person.', '2011-07-29 14:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484233, 963384, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice use of intenxe colors, light movement play on the music!</td>', 'Nice use of intenxe colors, light movement play on the music!', '2011-07-29 14:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484237, 964088, 136232, '<td valign="top">Great composition of cool colored back-lit flowers which emphasizes the raggety sharpness of the still flowers, the softened warm colored hand slowly approaching the flower, and neon sqiggly light giving rapid movement. Light, touch, sound!</td>', 'Great composition of cool colored back-lit flowers which emphasizes the raggety sharpness of the still flowers, the softened warm colored hand slowly approaching the flower, and neon sqiggly light giving rapid movement. Light, touch, sound!', '2011-07-29 14:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484241, 963561, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice non-obvious use of sound.  Nice cropping too, I can tell it is a substantial thundering horse even with just the legs.</td>', 'Nice non-obvious use of sound.  Nice cropping too, I can tell it is a substantial thundering horse even with just the legs.', '2011-07-29 14:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484244, 964089, 136232, '<td valign="top">Cute.  I would have waited for the cat to either close his eyes and rub against it (as they do when they pay their face), lick the flower with the tounge texture as a good contrast. or see if the cat would be willing to smell the flower.  Alas, cat subjects are often hard to pose!  The slight eyeblink of it''s right eye helps sell that the cat feels the flower I also like how you chose a pastel pink instead of a bright red, which helps accentuate the cat''s pastel nose, eyes, and lighter fur.</td>', 'Cute.  I would have waited for the cat to either close his eyes and rub against it (as they do when they pay their face), lick the flower with the tounge texture as a good contrast. or see if the cat would be willing to smell the flower.  Alas, cat subjects are often hard to pose!  The slight eyeblink of it''s right eye helps sell that the cat feels the flower I also like how you chose a pastel pink instead of a bright red, which helps accentuate the cat''s pastel nose, eyes, and lighter fur.', '2011-07-29 14:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484248, 964076, 136232, '<td valign="top">The strong colors against the black help sell the dry crispiness.</td>', 'The strong colors against the black help sell the dry crispiness.', '2011-07-29 14:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484250, 963791, 136232, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of light/defocus.  Also looks like it could be a picture in a fairy tale with the stars commign down around the child.</td>', 'Beautiful use of light/defocus.  Also looks like it could be a picture in a fairy tale with the stars commign down around the child.', '2011-07-29 14:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484255, 963636, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love how this one incorporates all senses, as well as working with an unpredictable animal model!  The bright greens, textured wood, silky fur, and bright juicy fruit are all sense triggering as well.  Nice capuchin!</td>', 'I love how this one incorporates all senses, as well as working with an unpredictable animal model!  The bright greens, textured wood, silky fur, and bright juicy fruit are all sense triggering as well.  Nice capuchin!', '2011-07-29 14:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484256, 963626, 136232, '<td valign="top">It might help with your title if the woman had a quizzical expression on her face, as if she''s contemplating whether or not her foot is indeed tasty.</td>', 'It might help with your title if the woman had a quizzical expression on her face, as if she''s contemplating whether or not her foot is indeed tasty.', '2011-07-29 15:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484257, 963968, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love how the composition is played with.  Looks like it could be used on a comercial for a healthy sweet snack.</td>', 'I love how the composition is played with.  Looks like it could be used on a comercial for a healthy sweet snack.', '2011-07-29 15:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484258, 963653, 136232, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eye shot.  The vision is clearly evident, but with a more interesting angle than straight on.  I even love how the cat is looking up, making the composition more interesting and piques the curiosity of the viewer!</td>', 'Beautiful eye shot.  The vision is clearly evident, but with a more interesting angle than straight on.  I even love how the cat is looking up, making the composition more interesting and piques the curiosity of the viewer!', '2011-07-29 15:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484259, 963720, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice timing</td>', 'Nice timing', '2011-07-29 15:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484260, 963924, 136232, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors.</td>', 'Brilliant colors.', '2011-07-29 15:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484262, 963630, 136232, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition of tasty neon food signs, with typical food in plastic, and a not so appetizing dirty cook statue.</td>', 'Interesting composition of tasty neon food signs, with typical food in plastic, and a not so appetizing dirty cook statue.', '2011-07-29 15:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484265, 963650, 136232, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, the wings are perfect... there''s tension as it is right before the bird gets to tast the flower.  I also love the backlighting, emphasizing the smooth sleekness of the bird and hairy texture of the plant!</td>', 'Beautiful shot, the wings are perfect... there''s tension as it is right before the bird gets to tast the flower.  I also love the backlighting, emphasizing the smooth sleekness of the bird and hairy texture of the plant!', '2011-07-29 15:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484271, 963387, 136232, '<td valign="top">Visually beautiful, but the scent might be more visually apparent if you had incense/steam/or a textured background to give the sense of feel over the velvety texture of the flower.</td>', 'Visually beautiful, but the scent might be more visually apparent if you had incense/steam/or a textured background to give the sense of feel over the velvety texture of the flower.', '2011-07-29 15:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484272, 963946, 136232, '<td valign="top">Cute, I like the sharp balm tree in the background to give visual interest as well.</td>', 'Cute, I like the sharp balm tree in the background to give visual interest as well.', '2011-07-29 15:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484273, 963931, 136232, '<td valign="top">It would have been neat if you could have somehow placed the ants on the flower, since they are a little hard to see when you first see the picture.  Insects are not always cooperative though.</td>', 'It would have been neat if you could have somehow placed the ants on the flower, since they are a little hard to see when you first see the picture.  Insects are not always cooperative though.', '2011-07-29 15:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484274, 963320, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the sense of movement of the clear water hitting the starfish. I also love how you chose a very textured starfish.  Looks cool and rough!</td>', 'I like the sense of movement of the clear water hitting the starfish. I also love how you chose a very textured starfish.  Looks cool and rough!', '2011-07-29 15:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484276, 964082, 136232, '<td valign="top">Having multiple sources of light would help you capture the steam coming from the coffee.  I''ve seen people use lights from a blind to highlight sections of it and give an intense focused light in bands for an interesting visual appeal.</td>', 'Having multiple sources of light would help you capture the steam coming from the coffee.  I''ve seen people use lights from a blind to highlight sections of it and give an intense focused light in bands for an interesting visual appeal.', '2011-07-29 15:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484277, 963545, 136232, '<td valign="top">I see touch, textures in the ment''s faces... I would have loved if the wood they were playing on showed more texture in either smooth reflections or rough graininess.</td>', 'I see touch, textures in the ment''s faces... I would have loved if the wood they were playing on showed more texture in either smooth reflections or rough graininess.', '2011-07-29 15:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484280, 963950, 136232, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, could be a foldgers commercial.  The artist in me thinks if you added a pile of sugar next to the cup, or some cinnamon sticks hidden in the sea of coffe beans it would add a more artistic and slightly less commercial feel to this picture. You can also play with the color of the lighting, with warm reds to imply a warm cup of coffee or cool blues for a cold morning for coffee.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, could be a foldgers commercial.  The artist in me thinks if you added a pile of sugar next to the cup, or some cinnamon sticks hidden in the sea of coffe beans it would add a more artistic and slightly less commercial feel to this picture. You can also play with the color of the lighting, with warm reds to imply a warm cup of coffee or cool blues for a cold morning for coffee.', '2011-07-29 15:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484281, 964072, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the original subject matter.  I''d be interested in hearing how you made the shot of what looks like one skyscrapper with a many faceted personality.</td>', 'I love the original subject matter.  I''d be interested in hearing how you made the shot of what looks like one skyscrapper with a many faceted personality.', '2011-07-29 15:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484282, 964043, 136232, '<td valign="top">The light captures the fabric beauitifully, and it comes alive from the black background.</td>', 'The light captures the fabric beauitifully, and it comes alive from the black background.', '2011-07-29 15:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484284, 964059, 136232, '<td valign="top">If you were below, looking up at the praying mantis, you could have gotten a "monster" big looking insect with a dramatic angle, and also be able to keep it more in focus.</td>', 'If you were below, looking up at the praying mantis, you could have gotten a "monster" big looking insect with a dramatic angle, and also be able to keep it more in focus.', '2011-07-29 15:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484287, 963916, 136232, '<td valign="top">The girl''s face is so beautiful, if there was a more bend to the hand to either be framign the face, or conforming to it''s curves it would be adding more three-dimensionality.  It looks a little as if the camera person put up their hand to stop the woman from comming any closer/too flat.  Beautifully soft colors though.</td>', 'The girl''s face is so beautiful, if there was a more bend to the hand to either be framign the face, or conforming to it''s curves it would be adding more three-dimensionality.  It looks a little as if the camera person put up their hand to stop the woman from comming any closer/too flat.  Beautifully soft colors though.', '2011-07-29 15:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484290, 963564, 136232, '<td valign="top">A pun on 3D pictures.  I like the sepia overtones to the obvious old pics.  With a smaller aperture you can get the double photos in focus as well.</td>', 'A pun on 3D pictures.  I like the sepia overtones to the obvious old pics.  With a smaller aperture you can get the double photos in focus as well.', '2011-07-29 15:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
