(6484870, 964017, 70921, '<td valign="top">Title should be "Sharp as a Tact".  the gold reflection at bottom center is distracting and the pin is too dead centered in the composition (review rule of thirds).  Lighting is very nice except for the reflection.</td>', 'Title should be "Sharp as a Tact".  the gold reflection at bottom center is distracting and the pin is too dead centered in the composition (review rule of thirds).  Lighting is very nice except for the reflection.', '2011-07-30 12:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484871, 963926, 70921, '<td valign="top">Flip the photo horizontally so bird is facing left</td>', 'Flip the photo horizontally so bird is facing left', '2011-07-30 12:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484877, 964007, 70921, '<td valign="top">Split profile, too much of back (right) eye showing... should only see the eyelash, body (shoulders) is awkward looking.  Bobby pins in hair are distracting.</td>', 'Split profile, too much of back (right) eye showing... should only see the eyelash, body (shoulders) is awkward looking.  Bobby pins in hair are distracting.', '2011-07-30 12:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484878, 963836, 70921, '<td valign="top">seen this million times... not enough detail in the shadows.</td>', 'seen this million times... not enough detail in the shadows.', '2011-07-30 12:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484879, 963387, 70921, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t expect to see a rose against a stark white background... all the white pulls the eye away from the flower and the water looks fake.  However good composition, focus and color make it better than an average flower photo.</td>', 'Wouldn''t expect to see a rose against a stark white background... all the white pulls the eye away from the flower and the water looks fake.  However good composition, focus and color make it better than an average flower photo.', '2011-07-30 12:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484883, 963726, 70921, '<td valign="top">Looks like a snapshot... photo doesn''t say anything, maybe the "notes" across the background should be strung to look like they are coming out of the radio?  Christmas coffee cup and shorts and sunglasses don''t jive.  Pay more attention to detail... what''s that glob of black stuff on ground at leg of table.  Lighting is too harsh and washes out the detail in the shoe and leg of subject.  Crop out a couple inches at top to get rid of the "too bright" background.</td>', 'Looks like a snapshot... photo doesn''t say anything, maybe the "notes" across the background should be strung to look like they are coming out of the radio?  Christmas coffee cup and shorts and sunglasses don''t jive.  Pay more attention to detail... what''s that glob of black stuff on ground at leg of table.  Lighting is too harsh and washes out the detail in the shoe and leg of subject.  Crop out a couple inches at top to get rid of the "too bright" background.', '2011-07-30 12:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484884, 963868, 70921, '<td valign="top">How does grabbing her butt add to the image? I took off 5 points for that, otherwise the black and white was pretty good other than the subjects being dead centered in the photo (review rule of thirds).  The pattern in the tile could have been used to create an interesting diagonal leading line if camera had moved to left which would have also given a less bright background at the top.</td>', 'How does grabbing her butt add to the image? I took off 5 points for that, otherwise the black and white was pretty good other than the subjects being dead centered in the photo (review rule of thirds).  The pattern in the tile could have been used to create an interesting diagonal leading line if camera had moved to left which would have also given a less bright background at the top.', '2011-07-30 12:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484886, 963740, 70921, '<td valign="top">Emphasis put on the bad tooth (or discolored gum around tooth) and skin... rather gimicky, thumb so out of focus is distracting.  I just don''t see the point.</td>', 'Emphasis put on the bad tooth (or discolored gum around tooth) and skin... rather gimicky, thumb so out of focus is distracting.  I just don''t see the point.', '2011-07-30 12:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484887, 963553, 70921, '<td valign="top">Cute baby but flat lighting and no light in the eyes with no catch lights and dark circles under eyes and black cavern in the mouth ruin the idea.</td>', 'Cute baby but flat lighting and no light in the eyes with no catch lights and dark circles under eyes and black cavern in the mouth ruin the idea.', '2011-07-30 12:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484888, 963401, 70921, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too harsh, composition is too dead centered (review rule of thirds) and not enough detail in shadows on subjects left side especially in the hair which disappears into the dark background.  The food in the mouth is a little distasteful.  The idea of the photo is just gross to me... sorry.</td>', 'Lighting is too harsh, composition is too dead centered (review rule of thirds) and not enough detail in shadows on subjects left side especially in the hair which disappears into the dark background.  The food in the mouth is a little distasteful.  The idea of the photo is just gross to me... sorry.', '2011-07-30 12:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484891, 963902, 70921, '<td valign="top">How is this a "nice" or flattering picture of this lady?  Foot is bigger than the subject.  Also dead centered foot in composition and deep shadows in water are distracting.  What''s that distracting item at top right corner of photo?  No detail (too much shadow) on woman''s face.  I just don''t like the idea, the composition, lighting or anything about it... sorry it just turned me off.</td>', 'How is this a "nice" or flattering picture of this lady?  Foot is bigger than the subject.  Also dead centered foot in composition and deep shadows in water are distracting.  What''s that distracting item at top right corner of photo?  No detail (too much shadow) on woman''s face.  I just don''t like the idea, the composition, lighting or anything about it... sorry it just turned me off.', '2011-07-30 12:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484892, 964107, 70921, '<td valign="top">NO redeeming characteristics... simply a gross photo</td>', 'NO redeeming characteristics... simply a gross photo', '2011-07-30 12:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484893, 963636, 70921, '<td valign="top">This is out of focus, what is it?</td>', 'This is out of focus, what is it?', '2011-07-30 12:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484894, 963910, 70921, '<td valign="top">Sorry I don''t "get it".  Muddy Mess</td>', 'Sorry I don''t "get it".  Muddy Mess', '2011-07-30 12:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484895, 963720, 70921, '<td valign="top">Nice double rainbow, good composition with horizon line not in the middle of the composition.  Losing detail in both shadows and highlights due to the extreme contrast of the scene but guess you couldn''t wait for better lighting... LOL.</td>', 'Nice double rainbow, good composition with horizon line not in the middle of the composition.  Losing detail in both shadows and highlights due to the extreme contrast of the scene but guess you couldn''t wait for better lighting... LOL.', '2011-07-30 12:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484901, 963653, 70921, '<td valign="top">Unusual and unique treatment of the subject... pretty cool. But, wish there was a little more depth of field and focus around nose.</td>', 'Unusual and unique treatment of the subject... pretty cool. But, wish there was a little more depth of field and focus around nose.', '2011-07-30 13:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484903, 963916, 70921, '<td valign="top">Nice color, great background and composition with subject "off center".  Since the hand is so large in comparison to face it would have been less distracting to have it in better focus maybe?  Actually I would have given it 3 more points without the hand... I don''t see how the hand added to the photo - it distracted.</td>', 'Nice color, great background and composition with subject "off center".  Since the hand is so large in comparison to face it would have been less distracting to have it in better focus maybe?  Actually I would have given it 3 more points without the hand... I don''t see how the hand added to the photo - it distracted.', '2011-07-30 13:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484906, 963990, 70921, '<td valign="top">Slower shutter speed would have shown some interesting motion in birds wings and water.  Good color and sharpness.  Would prefer the bird not be so dead centered (review rule of thirds).</td>', 'Slower shutter speed would have shown some interesting motion in birds wings and water.  Good color and sharpness.  Would prefer the bird not be so dead centered (review rule of thirds).', '2011-07-30 13:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484908, 963987, 70921, '<td valign="top">Good monotone color.  Good composition with dog''s head not dead centered.  Nice background and focus but would have preferred a tad more depth of field so dogs nose was in focus.</td>', 'Good monotone color.  Good composition with dog''s head not dead centered.  Nice background and focus but would have preferred a tad more depth of field so dogs nose was in focus.', '2011-07-30 13:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484909, 963791, 70921, '<td valign="top">Needs more light on face and too many white "spots" in water are distracting (you can spot these out in photoshop).  Good composition with subject not dead centered as so many photos I''ve seen.  Interesting idea for photo.</td>', 'Needs more light on face and too many white "spots" in water are distracting (you can spot these out in photoshop).  Good composition with subject not dead centered as so many photos I''ve seen.  Interesting idea for photo.', '2011-07-30 13:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484910, 963993, 70921, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and focus.  Good color and composition.</td>', 'Nice texture and focus.  Good color and composition.', '2011-07-30 13:05:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6484911, 963564, 70921, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and focus with good depth.  Good lighting.</td>', 'Nice composition and focus with good depth.  Good lighting.', '2011-07-30 13:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484913, 963924, 70921, '<td valign="top">Nice scenic... good composition but a tad over exposed (see no detail in waves hitting beach).  Print it a little darker and improve it a couple points.</td>', 'Nice scenic... good composition but a tad over exposed (see no detail in waves hitting beach).  Print it a little darker and improve it a couple points.', '2011-07-30 13:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484915, 964020, 70921, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition with the music not right in the dead center of the photo.  Good detail in both shadows and highlights.</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition with the music not right in the dead center of the photo.  Good detail in both shadows and highlights.', '2011-07-30 13:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484916, 963934, 70921, '<td valign="top">Sharp focus, great background and good composition and lighting considering this obviously wasn''t a "posed" shot.</td>', 'Sharp focus, great background and good composition and lighting considering this obviously wasn''t a "posed" shot.', '2011-07-30 13:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484919, 963980, 70921, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and color</td>', 'Good lighting and color', '2011-07-30 13:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484920, 963630, 70921, '<td valign="top">Do we have Topaz software? LOL.  Neat effect.  Suggestion... always look past your main subject to see what is distracting in the background.  It''s almost like the white cardboard menu in the background is growing out of his hand and the lights at top growing out of his hat.</td>', 'Do we have Topaz software? LOL.  Neat effect.  Suggestion... always look past your main subject to see what is distracting in the background.  It''s almost like the white cardboard menu in the background is growing out of his hand and the lights at top growing out of his hat.', '2011-07-30 13:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484921, 964072, 70921, '<td valign="top">SO busy but interesting... wish there were not so many reflections distracting from the people inside the windows.</td>', 'SO busy but interesting... wish there were not so many reflections distracting from the people inside the windows.', '2011-07-30 13:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484922, 964076, 70921, '<td valign="top">good lighting and texture</td>', 'good lighting and texture', '2011-07-30 13:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484923, 963700, 70921, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and color... very pleasing</td>', 'Nice composition and color... very pleasing', '2011-07-30 13:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484924, 964060, 70921, '<td valign="top">the dark shadow at bottom left is distracting... crop it out.  Lighting is nice giving skin a nice tone.</td>', 'the dark shadow at bottom left is distracting... crop it out.  Lighting is nice giving skin a nice tone.', '2011-07-30 13:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484925, 964094, 70921, '<td valign="top">Good composition with child not dead center in picture, except for a little too much foreground dirt at bottom and left... I''d crop a bit more of that out.  Nice reflection which makes the photo. The square pink object behind subject looks like it''s growning out of her body and is distracting whatever it is.</td>', 'Good composition with child not dead center in picture, except for a little too much foreground dirt at bottom and left... I''d crop a bit more of that out.  Nice reflection which makes the photo. The square pink object behind subject looks like it''s growning out of her body and is distracting whatever it is.', '2011-07-30 13:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484926, 963626, 70921, '<td valign="top">Good detail... looks enhanced by Topaz or other software.  The person(s) in the background are distracting... should have waited till the one at left moved out of photo and moved you and camera slightly to right to hide the one behind her head.  So many times we are concentrating on the subject and don''t take a quick glance behind the subject to see what''s going on in the background that will distract from our photo.</td>', 'Good detail... looks enhanced by Topaz or other software.  The person(s) in the background are distracting... should have waited till the one at left moved out of photo and moved you and camera slightly to right to hide the one behind her head.  So many times we are concentrating on the subject and don''t take a quick glance behind the subject to see what''s going on in the background that will distract from our photo.', '2011-07-30 13:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484927, 963561, 70921, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition would be even better cropped a bit more at left so hooves aren''t so dead center.  I like the monotone and good focus.</td>', 'Interesting composition would be even better cropped a bit more at left so hooves aren''t so dead center.  I like the monotone and good focus.', '2011-07-30 13:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484928, 963280, 70921, '<td valign="top">Forground object is so big and out of focus it distracts from the entire idea of the eyes.  Also the fingers are very distracting especially with the purple spots that look like bruises on the fingernails.  Background is blown out.  Good idea but not enough attention to details and distractions.</td>', 'Forground object is so big and out of focus it distracts from the entire idea of the eyes.  Also the fingers are very distracting especially with the purple spots that look like bruises on the fingernails.  Background is blown out.  Good idea but not enough attention to details and distractions.', '2011-07-30 13:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484930, 964043, 70921, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting except a tad "muddy" on the face... flip the photo so the subject faces left and I see the face first instead of the back of the head when my eyes come into the photo from the left.</td>', 'Nice lighting except a tad "muddy" on the face... flip the photo so the subject faces left and I see the face first instead of the back of the head when my eyes come into the photo from the left.', '2011-07-30 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484932, 963981, 70921, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and good composition... the wisp of smoke is a nice touch.</td>', 'Nice lighting and good composition... the wisp of smoke is a nice touch.', '2011-07-30 13:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484933, 963559, 70921, '<td valign="top">The label with the phone number is distracting... would have liked the photo better without it and the tin of Altoids.  Nice abstract background and good lighting on the coffee cup.</td>', 'The label with the phone number is distracting... would have liked the photo better without it and the tin of Altoids.  Nice abstract background and good lighting on the coffee cup.', '2011-07-30 13:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484934, 963873, 70921, '<td valign="top">Nice color, focus, background and border</td>', 'Nice color, focus, background and border', '2011-07-30 13:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484935, 963931, 70921, '<td valign="top">Good composition and focus.  I''d crop some of the out of focus foreground out as well as about half the flower... the ants are overpowered but these strong elements.</td>', 'Good composition and focus.  I''d crop some of the out of focus foreground out as well as about half the flower... the ants are overpowered but these strong elements.', '2011-07-30 13:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484939, 963994, 70921, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and monotone color... why not "flip" the image so the eye can "follow" the motion when the viewer comes into the photo from the left side.</td>', 'Interesting composition and monotone color... why not "flip" the image so the eye can "follow" the motion when the viewer comes into the photo from the left side.', '2011-07-30 13:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484940, 964112, 70921, '<td valign="top">"Through a glass dimly".  I like the color and effect and the diagonal lines of the window frame.</td>', '"Through a glass dimly".  I like the color and effect and the diagonal lines of the window frame.', '2011-07-30 13:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484941, 963950, 70921, '<td valign="top">If the coffee cup wasn''t dead center I''d like it better (rule of thirds).  Nice lighting and focus.</td>', 'If the coffee cup wasn''t dead center I''d like it better (rule of thirds).  Nice lighting and focus.', '2011-07-30 13:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484942, 963320, 70921, '<td valign="top">Nice "frozen" action.  Good composition and monotone color.  I''d crop a bit at the right to "move" the main part of the composition "off center" and but down on the dark area that pulls the eye away from the lighter water action.</td>', 'Nice "frozen" action.  Good composition and monotone color.  I''d crop a bit at the right to "move" the main part of the composition "off center" and but down on the dark area that pulls the eye away from the lighter water action.', '2011-07-30 13:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484943, 964011, 70921, '<td valign="top">Nice monotone, texture and composition.  Would have preferred to have a little more depth of field so lips weren''t so soft and a little more light on the forehead and lips.</td>', 'Nice monotone, texture and composition.  Would have preferred to have a little more depth of field so lips weren''t so soft and a little more light on the forehead and lips.', '2011-07-30 13:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484944, 964024, 70921, '<td valign="top">What is the first thing you see when looking at this photo?  The monogram "B" on the kids shirt... I would have taken his shirt off and also cropped in above the ladies elbow to get rid of all the distracting wrinkled clothing. Lighting is very flat on face and there is not enough light on hair resulting in no separation between subjects and background and loss of all detail of hair. Also would have had the child look up at camera as is the lady or had her look at the child for continuity.</td>', 'What is the first thing you see when looking at this photo?  The monogram "B" on the kids shirt... I would have taken his shirt off and also cropped in above the ladies elbow to get rid of all the distracting wrinkled clothing. Lighting is very flat on face and there is not enough light on hair resulting in no separation between subjects and background and loss of all detail of hair. Also would have had the child look up at camera as is the lady or had her look at the child for continuity.', '2011-07-30 13:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484945, 963270, 70921, '<td valign="top">Interesting... would be better with less void at bottom and needs to be a landscape format not vertical.  Too subject is too dead centered</td>', 'Interesting... would be better with less void at bottom and needs to be a landscape format not vertical.  Too subject is too dead centered', '2011-07-30 13:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484946, 963957, 70921, '<td valign="top">Good composition but muddy flat lighting on face and not enough detail in shadows of hair.  Needs some catch lights in the eyes.  Background not "out of focus" enough especially since it is so wrinkled.  Subject too close to background putting shadows (that end of looking like hair) from the hair onto the background.</td>', 'Good composition but muddy flat lighting on face and not enough detail in shadows of hair.  Needs some catch lights in the eyes.  Background not "out of focus" enough especially since it is so wrinkled.  Subject too close to background putting shadows (that end of looking like hair) from the hair onto the background.', '2011-07-30 13:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484947, 964052, 70921, '<td valign="top">Nice... improvements suggested... crop more of the woman out and right side and bottom which will also get rid of the distracting hot spot on her neck and the distracting black bra strap.  All you need of her is about an inch past her ear and only a sliver of her left shoulder.  Next time bounce a little light into the child''s face which will also brighten up the eyes that are a little dead. The lighting from the top is a bit bright washing out the child''s hair and giving the shadow on the face.  Nice pose but needs more thought as to distracting elements and lighting.</td>', 'Nice... improvements suggested... crop more of the woman out and right side and bottom which will also get rid of the distracting hot spot on her neck and the distracting black bra strap.  All you need of her is about an inch past her ear and only a sliver of her left shoulder.  Next time bounce a little light into the child''s face which will also brighten up the eyes that are a little dead. The lighting from the top is a bit bright washing out the child''s hair and giving the shadow on the face.  Nice pose but needs more thought as to distracting elements and lighting.', '2011-07-30 13:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484948, 963932, 70921, '<td valign="top">I''d flip this so the subject would be facing the other way so when my eyes come in from the left of the photo I wouldn''t come into the back of her head.  Good composition with subject not dead center (good rule of thirds).  Clothing is very distracting... would have preferred a solid color dress with all the spots of color around the photo from the flowers.  Lighting is a bit harsh on the arms and face making subject look "bigger" which the patterned dress also does.</td>', 'I''d flip this so the subject would be facing the other way so when my eyes come in from the left of the photo I wouldn''t come into the back of her head.  Good composition with subject not dead center (good rule of thirds).  Clothing is very distracting... would have preferred a solid color dress with all the spots of color around the photo from the flowers.  Lighting is a bit harsh on the arms and face making subject look "bigger" which the patterned dress also does.', '2011-07-30 13:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484949, 963907, 70921, '<td valign="top">the strong white highlight to the right middle takes attention away from the composition... I''d crop it out even though that will cut into the eye a bit.  Wild color, good sharpness and lighting except for that glare at right.</td>', 'the strong white highlight to the right middle takes attention away from the composition... I''d crop it out even though that will cut into the eye a bit.  Wild color, good sharpness and lighting except for that glare at right.', '2011-07-30 13:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484950, 963970, 70921, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to say... it''s stark.  Guess it''s "in the eyes of the beholder".  I don''t get it but I''m more of a realist.  LOL</td>', 'I don''t know what to say... it''s stark.  Guess it''s "in the eyes of the beholder".  I don''t get it but I''m more of a realist.  LOL', '2011-07-30 13:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484951, 964088, 70921, '<td valign="top">Too busy.  I''d like it better without the colored lines at right that obscure the hand.</td>', 'Too busy.  I''d like it better without the colored lines at right that obscure the hand.', '2011-07-30 13:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484952, 963799, 70921, '<td valign="top">Distracting elements... spray bottle at bottom right, white plate and partial knife at left, half of vase with purple flower at right.  Should just be grill and food... zoom in a tad.</td>', 'Distracting elements... spray bottle at bottom right, white plate and partial knife at left, half of vase with purple flower at right.  Should just be grill and food... zoom in a tad.', '2011-07-30 13:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484953, 964089, 70921, '<td valign="top">Adding the flower didn''t add to the composition but rather distracts from the subject... nice lighting on the cat''s face.</td>', 'Adding the flower didn''t add to the composition but rather distracts from the subject... nice lighting on the cat''s face.', '2011-07-30 13:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484954, 963968, 70921, '<td valign="top">Good light and composition... cute idea</td>', 'Good light and composition... cute idea', '2011-07-30 13:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484959, 963946, 70921, '<td valign="top">Out of focus fingers are very distracting.  Composition is dead centered (review rule of thirds) and lighting is harsh.  Background items (fronds) are very distracting.</td>', 'Out of focus fingers are very distracting.  Composition is dead centered (review rule of thirds) and lighting is harsh.  Background items (fronds) are very distracting.', '2011-07-30 13:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484960, 964084, 70921, '<td valign="top">Highlights blown out on forehead and left cheek and needs a tad more detail in the shadow side.</td>', 'Highlights blown out on forehead and left cheek and needs a tad more detail in the shadow side.', '2011-07-30 13:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484961, 963988, 70921, '<td valign="top">Just too many distracting elements for a monotone.  Dark shirt on subject is very distracting and background behind subject is too blown out.</td>', 'Just too many distracting elements for a monotone.  Dark shirt on subject is very distracting and background behind subject is too blown out.', '2011-07-30 13:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484962, 964010, 70921, '<td valign="top">Wait for their heads to come up!  Go back when the lighting isn''t so harsh and directly overhead.</td>', 'Wait for their heads to come up!  Go back when the lighting isn''t so harsh and directly overhead.', '2011-07-30 13:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6484963, 964062, 70921, '<td valign="top">Not enough light in the shadows... some black faces can''t be distinguished from their hats and not enough detail in some items like the musical instruments.  Entire print is a little "muddy" looking.</td>', 'Not enough light in the shadows... some black faces can''t be distinguished from their hats and not enough detail in some items like the musical instruments.  Entire print is a little "muddy" looking.', '2011-07-30 13:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6485120, 963993, 14476, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  I like it.  <br/>I do wish it had been sharp throughout though, so that both heart decorations would balance and compliment each other. But the warm wood tones and obvious anticipation of hearing lovely sound makes this a keeper.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  I like it.  I do wish it had been sharp throughout though, so that both heart decorations would balance and compliment each other. But the warm wood tones and obvious anticipation of hearing lovely sound makes this a keeper.', '2011-07-30 20:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6485121, 963979, 14476, '<td valign="top">Now this has verve, excitement and joy - all in one photograph.  <br/> <br/>For me, the heavy black border is - I''m sorry - a non-starter.<br/>I keep looking away (whether I want to or not, and I don''t want to) to<br/>confront that blackness surrounding this vivacious little guy having<br/>a wonderful time.</td>', 'Now this has verve, excitement and joy - all in one photograph.   For me, the heavy black border is - I''m sorry - a non-starter.I keep looking away (whether I want to or not, and I don''t want to) toconfront that blackness surrounding this vivacious little guy havinga wonderful time.', '2011-07-30 20:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
