(6487522, 963897, 120171, '<td valign="top">Stand out winner for me in this challenge. I suspect this has been taken by the great squirrel tamer. Lovely image.</td>', 'Stand out winner for me in this challenge. I suspect this has been taken by the great squirrel tamer. Lovely image.', '2011-08-01 19:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487527, 963868, 120171, '<td valign="top">I hope you were using your zoom cos if they heard your camera click i suspect you might have to start running :)<br/>Great lines leading to the centre composition.<br/>Top 3 for sure.</td>', 'I hope you were using your zoom cos if they heard your camera click i suspect you might have to start running :)Great lines leading to the centre composition.Top 3 for sure.', '2011-08-01 19:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487528, 964052, 120171, '<td valign="top">I really like the softness of this shot which really reflects your title, hope to see this in the top 3.</td>', 'I really like the softness of this shot which really reflects your title, hope to see this in the top 3.', '2011-08-01 19:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487535, 963650, 136346, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, you are fortunate to have witnessed this.  I would like to give high marks, but the thing that is missing is the tongue.  If the tongue was there, it would be an ace!</td>', 'This is a great photo, you are fortunate to have witnessed this.  I would like to give high marks, but the thing that is missing is the tongue.  If the tongue was there, it would be an ace!', '2011-08-01 19:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487538, 963559, 136346, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but I am uncertain of the relationship of the title to the image and the contest.</td>', 'I like the shot, but I am uncertain of the relationship of the title to the image and the contest.', '2011-08-01 19:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487539, 964112, 136346, '<td valign="top">uhm, not sure how this fits the theme...</td>', 'uhm, not sure how this fits the theme...', '2011-08-01 19:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487542, 963980, 136346, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and composition, content, that''s another thing, lol.  I can appreciate the idea and effort though...</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and composition, content, that''s another thing, lol.  I can appreciate the idea and effort though...', '2011-08-01 19:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487548, 963561, 136346, '<td valign="top">I love the concept: I only wish the front hoof was better exposed and visible.  I appreciate the effort to capture this, and the goal is to show the ''source'' of the thunder, but it would have maybe been a stronger image to show just a bit more leg.  (My $0.02)</td>', 'I love the concept: I only wish the front hoof was better exposed and visible.  I appreciate the effort to capture this, and the goal is to show the ''source'' of the thunder, but it would have maybe been a stronger image to show just a bit more leg.  (My $0.02)', '2011-08-01 19:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487554, 964011, 136346, '<td valign="top">my preference would be to have both eyes in focus, or the out of focus one more out of focus (so it looks intentional)</td>', 'my preference would be to have both eyes in focus, or the out of focus one more out of focus (so it looks intentional)', '2011-08-01 19:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487557, 964088, 136346, '<td valign="top">ouch! my eyes hurt!!  That''s the [one of the] five senses!</td>', 'ouch! my eyes hurt!!  That''s the [one of the] five senses!', '2011-08-01 19:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487561, 963994, 136346, '<td valign="top">My sense of site must be going, everything is blurry.  The content seems lost in the composition, sorry,</td>', 'My sense of site must be going, everything is blurry.  The content seems lost in the composition, sorry,', '2011-08-01 19:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487579, 964072, 136346, '<td valign="top">If this is basic editing, then wow, this is pretty cool.  So many colours split into defined sections, how is it possible?  Assuming this has been deemed qualified, then I will vote accordingly.  The more I see the more there is to see. WOW.</td>', 'If this is basic editing, then wow, this is pretty cool.  So many colours split into defined sections, how is it possible?  Assuming this has been deemed qualified, then I will vote accordingly.  The more I see the more there is to see. WOW.', '2011-08-01 20:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487599, 964020, 136346, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen both pages of the foreground book in focus.  The books in the background could have been blurry.  Compositionally, the title at the top of the page, it is distracting being cut off like that, try either not showing it, or including the whole title.  When you adjust the top, leave the bottom of the image - it is cropped perfectly.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen both pages of the foreground book in focus.  The books in the background could have been blurry.  Compositionally, the title at the top of the page, it is distracting being cut off like that, try either not showing it, or including the whole title.  When you adjust the top, leave the bottom of the image - it is cropped perfectly.', '2011-08-01 20:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487769, 963868, 18367, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that something to behold... that nice gentleman helping that young woman by adjusting her wardrobe.<br/> <br/>Great capture... the best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Isn''t that something to behold... that nice gentleman helping that young woman by adjusting her wardrobe. Great capture... the best of luck in the challenge.', '2011-08-01 22:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488122, 963950, 58634, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this, and the way the light falls on the coffee beans creating very pretty lit and shadowed areas. I would''ve preferred for the cup to be still, as opposed to something being poured into it because IMHO it makes it look a bit awkward.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this, and the way the light falls on the coffee beans creating very pretty lit and shadowed areas. I would''ve preferred for the cup to be still, as opposed to something being poured into it because IMHO it makes it look a bit awkward.', '2011-08-02 04:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488123, 963987, 58634, '<td valign="top">Depth of Field here is gorgeous.</td>', 'Depth of Field here is gorgeous.', '2011-08-02 04:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488125, 963946, 58634, '<td valign="top">Straighforward. Good use of DOF between the face and the magnifying glas.. However the focus on the plant on the lower left hand is awkward, and in fact, I think the plant in itself detracts from the image as a whole.</td>', 'Straighforward. Good use of DOF between the face and the magnifying glas.. However the focus on the plant on the lower left hand is awkward, and in fact, I think the plant in itself detracts from the image as a whole.', '2011-08-02 04:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488127, 963280, 58634, '<td valign="top">Feels like too much of a snapshot to me.. However, I kind of like the sort of angel-like lighting obtained from behind against your head.</td>', 'Feels like too much of a snapshot to me.. However, I kind of like the sort of angel-like lighting obtained from behind against your head.', '2011-08-02 04:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488128, 963993, 58634, '<td valign="top">Good focus and dogf used. I think the frame compliments the image also. As a whole, I am not sure this fits the challenge TOO well, but the image isn''t bad.</td>', 'Good focus and dogf used. I think the frame compliments the image also. As a whole, I am not sure this fits the challenge TOO well, but the image isn''t bad.', '2011-08-02 04:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488129, 964061, 58634, '<td valign="top">What a silly shot! love it!</td>', 'What a silly shot! love it!', '2011-08-02 04:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488130, 963970, 58634, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out exactly what is too late and why...  Aside from that, the image seems overprocessed and oversharpened.</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out exactly what is too late and why...  Aside from that, the image seems overprocessed and oversharpened.', '2011-08-02 04:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488131, 963630, 58634, '<td valign="top">Not an image that particularly stands out, but you sure are getting your point across. good composition, angle and lighting.</td>', 'Not an image that particularly stands out, but you sure are getting your point across. good composition, angle and lighting.', '2011-08-02 04:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488132, 963320, 58634, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the almost diamond-like patters and the way they shine. Very pretty.</td>', 'I enjoy the almost diamond-like patters and the way they shine. Very pretty.', '2011-08-02 04:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488136, 964007, 58634, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait, a bit on the light side, but its not overblown and it looks very flawless.<br/>I like the way the pins in her hair stand out, making her (and this image) look very classic and beautiful. <br/>The DOF really works for you here also, as the bokeh makes her face and expression stand out a lot.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait, a bit on the light side, but its not overblown and it looks very flawless.I like the way the pins in her hair stand out, making her (and this image) look very classic and beautiful. The DOF really works for you here also, as the bokeh makes her face and expression stand out a lot.', '2011-08-02 05:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488137, 963897, 58634, '<td valign="top">This has got to be Wendy! I recognize the vase, as well as the squirrel (duh!)<br/>So beautifully captured! Excellent horizontal composition! and the frame adds a lot to the composition, too!</td>', 'This has got to be Wendy! I recognize the vase, as well as the squirrel (duh!)So beautifully captured! Excellent horizontal composition! and the frame adds a lot to the composition, too!', '2011-08-02 05:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488138, 964084, 58634, '<td valign="top">Beautiful green eyes!</td>', 'Beautiful green eyes!', '2011-08-02 05:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488139, 963720, 58634, '<td valign="top">Excellent and original take on the challenge. Beautiful capture, no doubt about that. Love all the colors in here (and I''m not particularly talking about the rainbow colors!)<br/>Front page!</td>', 'Excellent and original take on the challenge. Beautiful capture, no doubt about that. Love all the colors in here (and I''m not particularly talking about the rainbow colors!)Front page!', '2011-08-02 05:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488140, 963979, 58634, '<td valign="top">He looks so happy, joyful and full of life! Excellent capture.</td>', 'He looks so happy, joyful and full of life! Excellent capture.', '2011-08-02 05:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488141, 963873, 58634, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flowers, I wish they were more defined and thatthere was an overall higher clarity to the image.</td>', 'Beautiful flowers, I wish they were more defined and thatthere was an overall higher clarity to the image.', '2011-08-02 05:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488142, 964060, 58634, '<td valign="top">Sort of like a little kid holding on to his blankie, very sweet.</td>', 'Sort of like a little kid holding on to his blankie, very sweet.', '2011-08-02 05:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488143, 964010, 58634, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous lighting for a beautiful capture.</td>', 'Gorgeous lighting for a beautiful capture.', '2011-08-02 05:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488145, 963270, 58634, '<td valign="top">Love this! Very original!</td>', 'Love this! Very original!', '2011-08-02 05:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488146, 963907, 58634, '<td valign="top">Oh wow... a bit too close for comfort! But wowzers!</td>', 'Oh wow... a bit too close for comfort! But wowzers!', '2011-08-02 05:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488147, 963791, 58634, '<td valign="top">I have always loved the way light shines through water.. It always adds a sense of fantasy to a photograph.</td>', 'I have always loved the way light shines through water.. It always adds a sense of fantasy to a photograph.', '2011-08-02 05:14:11.000000', NULL, 1);
