(6489862, 963994, 66398, '<td valign="top">you may have already been told this but I think you should have entered this in the corresponding challenge. This one was supposed to be one of the 5 senses. I could see this photo in this challenge with a different title like maybe "lost sight" because it''s a great photo. It''s very interesting to look at. And if you look to where the eyes would be it almost appears as if there are just holes there with no eyes. And then this might be something someone who is going blind would see. But your title makes me think it should be in the other challenge. I''m still scoring on the merits of the shot and giving it a 7</td>', 'you may have already been told this but I think you should have entered this in the corresponding challenge. This one was supposed to be one of the 5 senses. I could see this photo in this challenge with a different title like maybe "lost sight" because it''s a great photo. It''s very interesting to look at. And if you look to where the eyes would be it almost appears as if there are just holes there with no eyes. And then this might be something someone who is going blind would see. But your title makes me think it should be in the other challenge. I''m still scoring on the merits of the shot and giving it a 7', '2011-08-03 00:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
