(6490238, 963950, 49578, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much for the very nice comments. It is amusing to note that some people prefer the movement in the frame while some prefer it static. Maybe a reshoot with rule of thirds will turn out worthwhile!<br/> <br/>The composition is largely inspired from the following image by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53147" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">timfythetoo</a> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=939211" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1354/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_939211.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1354/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_939211.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1354/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_939211.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Maybe I should have made the coffee tad lighter :)</td>', 'Thank you so much for the very nice comments. It is amusing to note that some people prefer the movement in the frame while some prefer it static. Maybe a reshoot with rule of thirds will turn out worthwhile! The composition is largely inspired from the following image by  timfythetoo   Maybe I should have made the coffee tad lighter :)', '2011-08-03 03:07:07.000000', NULL, 0),
