(6492555, 963726, 134562, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sfalice:</b></div><hr/><i> waaay too cute!  And some crafty work here too to make those musical notes.<br/> <br/>Okay, I''m gonna go out on a limb here and offer some composing thoughts. You have set a delightful scene here, but it has a lot of information.  More, perhaps that is needed to tell your story.  <br/> <br/>Those musical notes.  Perfect.  Now. Think about cropping the top to just above the right  ''blue note'' - then think about cropping the bottom to just above the models knee.  <br/> <br/>Then, to tidy up a bit, crop the left side to just the left of the pink note.  <br/> <br/>There.  Does that also tell the story you want to say?<br/> <br/>Okay, Alice''s lesson for the day is over.  (Joking, of course)<br/>:) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>thanx a lot .. its the most helpful comment i have ever had .. i would love to have more of these lessons ^_^ :)</td>', 'Originally posted by sfalice: waaay too cute!  And some crafty work here too to make those musical notes. Okay, I''m gonna go out on a limb here and offer some composing thoughts. You have set a delightful scene here, but it has a lot of information.  More, perhaps that is needed to tell your story.   Those musical notes.  Perfect.  Now. Think about cropping the top to just above the right  ''blue note'' - then think about cropping the bottom to just above the models knee.   Then, to tidy up a bit, crop the left side to just the left of the pink note.   There.  Does that also tell the story you want to say? Okay, Alice''s lesson for the day is over.  (Joking, of course):)   thanx a lot .. its the most helpful comment i have ever had .. i would love to have more of these lessons ^_^ :)', '2011-08-04 07:47:52.000000', NULL, 0),
